105	/**
106	 * Build the concrete web owner-reconcile transport for a SINGLE reconcile pass,
107	 * scoped to the root whose `shareRootIpnsName` is closed over here.
108	 *
109	 * The `getRecipientPubkeyPins` seam (D-03d consumer 3, 80-08) supplies the
110	 * node's owner-sealed `recipientPins` so runOwnerReconcile's 80-07 `getPinsFn`
111	 * enforcement can fail-closed verify each surviving grant's recipient BEFORE
112	 * re-wrapping (never trusting the relay-fed `/shares/sent` recipientPublicKey).
113	 * The sdk-core seam threads the `rootNodeId`, but `client.getRecipientPubkeyPins`
